z += '''\n\n## V63 — Canonical continuation\nV63, V62 ZIP'i üzerine kurulmuştur. Current source of truth: this ZIP.\n\n### V63 changes\n- Export `v63` adds optional HMAC-SHA256 signature metadata using Worker secrets; client never receives signing secrets.\n- `SHARE_EXPORT_SIGNING_KEY_ID` provides rotation identity; `tournament_share_export_keys` records lifecycle metadata.\n- Owner-only alert audit filtering route: `/api/tournaments/:id/share/health/alerts/audit`.\n- Owner-only maintenance replay route: `/api/tournaments/:id/share/health/maintenance/replay`; it is dry-run and never performs retention deletion.\n- Replay history is stored in `tournament_share_maintenance_replays`.\n- Frontend includes maintenance replay diagnostics and alert audit samples.\n\n### V63 validation / limitations\n- `node scripts/regression-v63.mjs` => `V63 regression OK`\n- Full TypeScript/Vite build remains blocked by inherited parser/dependency limitations.\n- Real Cloudflare/D1/CDN/browser production validation not performed.\n\n### NEXT CHAT\nYeni sohbet V63 ZIP'ini temel almalıdır. Önce `ZATO_PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`, `V63_RELEASE_NOTES.md` ve `V63_PRODUCTION_CHECKLIST.md` okunmalı; V63 gerçek kaynak kabul edilmelidir.\n\n### Next logical step\n**V64 — signed export verification contract, key lifecycle UI, maintenance replay diff view, alert audit pagination, and automated migration/route matrix.**\n'''
